# Firebase config — committed only via signed releases (CI injects it
# from a secret), never from local dev. The Android API key alone is
# safe to expose, but the service-account JSON is admin-grade — never
# commit either to keep the policy uniform and easy to remember.
android/app/google-services.json
firebase-service-account*.json
